  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 62acb01c5d2178a4e9b90a0d4606cba9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NewspaperInteractable
  newspaperTitle: NHAT BAO VUNG BIEN GIOI
  issueDate: Dem thu 1
  newspaperContent: 'TINH TRANG CANH BAO AN NINH MUC DO CAO


    Chinh quyen dia
    phuong xac nhan co nhieu dot dot nhap bat thuong tai vung bien gioi phia bac
    trong nhung ngay vua qua.


    Cac nhan vien bao canh da duoc lenh tang cuong
    kiem tra giay to va bao cao ngay lap tuc neu phat hien di the la hoac hoat dong
    kha nghi.


    --- THONG BAO NOI BO ---

    Bot canh so 7 can dac biet chu
    y. Khong duoc phep de bat cu ai vao ma khong co giay to hop le.


    Chuc anh
    em ca dem canh giac.'
  fontAsset: {fileID: 0}
  paperColor: {r: 0.7607844, g: 0.7607844, b: 0.7607844, a: 1}
  titleColor: {r: 0.08, g: 0.08, b: 0.08, a: 1}
  contentColor: {r: 0.12, g: 0.12, b: 0.12, a: 1}
  rustleSound: {fileID: 0}
  _prompt: Doc bao
